#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:385
msgid ""
"The Default Country Code is used to format numbers that don't include an "
"international prefix (e.g., +358).\n"
"\n"
"If left empty, the system tries to detect it automatically from your SIM "
"card or network.\n"
"\n"
"You can manually override it here by entering a 2-letter ISO region code (e."
"g. US, FI, DE) or a calling code (e.g. +358, 358, +1, 1)."
msgstr ""
"Úsáidtear an Cód Tíre Réamhshocraithe chun uimhreacha a fhormáidiú nach n-"
"áirítear réimír idirnáisiúnta (m.sh., +358).\n"
"\n"
"Má fhágtar folamh é, déanann an córas iarracht é a bhrath go huathoibríoch ó "
"do chárta SIM nó do líonra.\n"
"\n"
"Is féidir leat é a shárú de láimh anseo trí chód réigiúin ISO dhá litir a "
"chur isteach (m.sh. SAM, FI, DE) nó cód glaonna (m.sh. +358, 358, +1, 1)."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:413
msgid ""
"Carriers limit how large a multimedia message can be. Images and videos you "
"attach are automatically compressed to fit under this limit before sending.\n"
"\n"
"Automatic uses the limit reported by the phone's MMS service, which is right "
"for most carriers. Pick a smaller value if your messages fail to send, or a "
"larger one if you know your carrier allows it."
msgstr ""
"Cuireann iompróirí teorainn le méid teachtaireachta ilmheán. Déantar na "
"híomhánna agus na físeáin a cheanglaíonn tú a chomhbhrú go huathoibríoch "
"chun iad a choinneáil faoin teorainn seo sula seoltar iad.\n"
"\n"
"Úsáideann Uathoibríoch an teorainn a thuairiscíonn seirbhís MMS an fhóin, "
"atá ceart don chuid is mó d'iompróirí. Roghnaigh luach níos lú má theipeann "
"ar do theachtaireachtaí seoladh, nó ceann níos mó má tá a fhios agat go "
"gceadaíonn d'iompróir é."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:435
msgid ""
"The ringback tone is the sound played (toot-toot-toot) while waiting for an "
"outgoing call to be answered. Some carriers don't generate it so we have "
"option to generate it manually here. \n"
"\n"
"You can select your own music file, or clear it to use the standard system "
"tone."
msgstr ""
"Is é an ton aisghlaoite an fhuaim a sheinntear (toot-toot-toot) agus tú ag "
"fanacht le freagra a thabhairt ar ghlao atá ag dul amach. Ní ghineann roinnt "
"iompróirí é agus mar sin tá rogha againn é a ghiniúint de láimh anseo. \n"
"\n"
"Is féidir leat do chomhad ceoil féin a roghnú, nó é a ghlanadh chun ton "
"caighdeánach an chórais a úsáid."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:455
msgid "Select Ringback Tone"
msgstr "Roghnaigh Ringback Tone"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:463
msgid "Audio Files"
msgstr "Comhaid Fuaime"

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:489
msgid ""
"Select the address books to use with Telephony and arrange them in order of "
"priority. The topmost address book has the highest priority and will be "
"preferred if a number is found in multiple address books. You can use the "
"Duplicate Resolver toggle below to help manage duplicates, but even if "
"disabled, we encourage enabling it for a better experience."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh na leabhair seoltaí le húsáid le Teileafónaíocht agus cuir in ord "
"tosaíochta iad. Tá an tosaíocht is airde ag an leabhar seoltaí is airde agus "
"is fearr é má aimsítear uimhir i leabhair seoltaí iolracha. Is féidir leat "
"an Duplicate Resolver a úsáid thíos chun cabhrú le dúblaigh a bhainistiú, "
"ach fiú má tá sé díchumasaithe, molaimid é a chumasú le haghaidh eispéireas "
"níos fearr."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:508
msgid ""
"When enabled, if the same phone number calls you 3 times within 5 minutes, "
"the third call (and subsequent ones within the window) will force the phone "
"to ring at maximum volume, bypassing Silent or Do Not Disturb modes."
msgstr ""
"Nuair a bheidh sé cumasaithe, má ghlaonn an uimhir theileafóin chéanna ort 3 "
"huaire laistigh de 5 nóiméad, cuirfidh an tríú glao (agus na cinn ina "
"dhiaidh sin laistigh den fhuinneog) iallach ar an bhfón glaoch ag an toirt "
"uasta, ag seachaint modhanna Chiúin nó Ná Cuir Isteach."

#: src/telephony/ui/windows/settings_window.py:520
msgid ""
"Choose contacts that will always play notifications at full volume, even "
"when the phone is in Silent or Do Not Disturb mode."
msgstr ""
"Roghnaigh teagmhálaithe a imreoidh fógraí ag an toirt iomlán i gcónaí, fiú "
"nuair a bhíonn an fón i mód Chiúin nó Ná Cuir Isteach."

